      "id": "claim_dfa7b27d33224a4a9e16edb9f03a1f54",
      "statement": "The account commerce workflow is split across `/account/orders`, `/account/orders/:id`, `/account/aftersales`, and `/account/aftersales/:id`; route pages render tabs, pagination, states, dialogs, and navigation while dedicated composables own request state and mutations, API clients own endpoint transport, and transformers convert raw responses into view models.",
