      "id": "claim_6d1cedebcf504b1493404ef8cb4a0534",
      "statement": "Order transformation is the action-policy boundary: it normalizes API payment, cancellation, delivery, offline voucher, and item aftersales data into statuses and capability flags governing cancellation, payment, voucher correction, receipt confirmation, invoice, logistics, aftersales, and review actions; partial delivery remains pending shipment but changes the action rules.",
