    {
      "id": "claim_76259075496e4ea2b92893a7eaed7cc5",
      "statement": "Order cancellation is centralized in `useOrderCancel`: paid orders open a reason modal, unpaid orders require confirmation, submission builds a reason-aware payload and calls `POST /wxapp/order/cancel`, and successful cancellation invokes the caller's refresh callback; receipt confirmation and deletion similarly confirm, call their API methods, toast, and refresh.",
