      "statement": "Logistics uses `/wxapp/trackerpull` and tolerates tracker failures by falling back to traces embedded in order detail; tracker traces are mapped from `AcceptTime` and `AcceptStation`, common logistics error codes suppress global transport toasts, and an error is shown only when no fallback traces exist.",
